# Multiroom Music Hub

## Run locally

### Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 18 or later
- npm

### Setup

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd Multiroom-Music-Hub
npm install
```

If the project includes an environment template, create your local environment file:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

Update `.env` with the required local configuration, then start the development server:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open the local URL printed in the terminal, typically:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

## Production build

```bash
npm run build
npm start
```
